        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDS125, Short Baseboard Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana made short solid brass bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. From high-end residences to large commercial projects, Deltana is the nation\u0019's most complete provider of all of your door hardware needs. Supplied with a gray rubber tip and mounting screw stud. It is made out of solid brass and is available in great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDS125-specifications.gif?v=1704354535\" width\"428\" height=\"211\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Short Baseboard Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-1-4-inch-baseboard-door-bumper-deltana-bds30\"><b>3-1/4 inch baseboard door stop</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-baseboard-door-bumper-deltana-bds425\"><b>4 inch  baseboard door stop</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-baseboard-door-bumper\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>.\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BDS125 Short Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BDS125.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  BDS125 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 1-3/8 Inch Short Baseboard Door Stop",
                "description": "Short Baseboard Door Bumper, Deltana BDS125 - This Deltana made short solid brass bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. From high-end residences to large commercial projects, Deltana is the nation\u0019's most complete provider of all of your door hardware needs. Supplied with a gray rubber tip and mounting screw stud. It is made out of solid brass and is available 9 great finishes. ",
